  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "英美法學經典導讀",
    "sub_ename": "AN INTRODUCTION TO ANGLO-AMERICAN LEGAL CLASSICS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程會選擇數篇英美法律經典文章、判決作為課堂討論文本。通過閱讀和討論這些經典文本，讓同學們對美國法律概念與美國司法制度，能有一定的理解。\n完成課程後，學生將能夠：\n1.對美國法律經典著作有基本的了解\n2.了解美國文化及其形成\n3.提高英語閱讀能力",
    "describe_eh": "I will choose the classic papers of Anglo-American law in this course. Through reading and discussing these classic papers, I hope the students can have a fundamental understanding of the U.S. legal concepts and U.S. legal systems.\nUpon finishing the course, students will be able to:\n1. have a basic understanding of the classic works of the U.S. law\n2. learn the U.S. culture and its formation\n3. improve the English reading ability",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能熟悉英美法律體制與基本法律概念",
      "describe_en": " Familiar with the Anglo-American legal systems."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "針對經典法律議題能有思考批判能力",
      "describe_en": "Able to think critically on classic legal issues"
    }
  ],
